implementationPlan.description:
Single final verification gate. From the repo root, run exactly:
`node scripts/tests/postflight-safe.mjs bash && bash scripts/tests/worktree-landing.sh && bash scripts/tests/parity-check.sh && diff <(grep -oE 'MOE_(WORKTREE|LAND|CONTROL|BOARD|MIGRATION|PUSH)_[A-Z0-9_]+' scripts/moe-agent.sh | sort -u) <(grep -oE 'MOE_(WORKTREE|LAND|CONTROL|BOARD|MIGRATION|PUSH)_[A-Z0-9_]+' scripts/moe-agent.ps1 | sort -u)`

Require all of these:
- failureClass NONE;
- the held-out landing cases green and byte-unchanged, checked by a read-only diff against WT-08T's landed version;
- parity PASS;
- an empty diff;
- exit 0.

On a native Windows seat, also run `node scripts/tests/postflight-safe.mjs powershell` at the same revision. It must run under Windows PowerShell 5.1, not as a skipped or substituted pwsh result. Without a Windows seat, say so in complete_task instead of claiming it.

Load regression-check and verification-before-completion. Submit the fresh command, its exit code and the safe output tail as the complete_task evidence. Keep raw postflight output out of chat.

Final adversarial self-review, once, scoped to this diff. Load adversarial-self-review, then read the diff as a racing peer and as a crash.

Probe these situations:
- a peer push between L4 and L9;
- a remote that applies C while the client sees an error;
- SIGINT/SIGTERM before, during and after L9;
- branch names with slashes, or equal to main;
- a branch already contained in main;
- main checked out in some worktree;
- .moe paths in M;
- MOE_DISABLE_QUALITY_GATE=1;
- a --worker-id that names a live seat.

Confirm all of the following:
- No path prints MOE_MIGRATION_LANDED or exits 0 without a confirmed publication or a true nothing-to-commit.
- Nothing is published after a refusal.
- No push uses --force, -f, --force-with-lease or a '+' refspec.
- C always has tree M and exactly the parents [B, tip].
- No RPC, lease, journal, rescue ref, Candidate, CheckRun or ledger row exists.
- The source branch never moves.
- The completion arm and shared mode are unchanged.

Keep the source+test diff within 400 net non-board LOC by reusing the landed helpers, not by dropping cases. After any fix, re-run step 4's command fresh.
